  "description": "This application considers the replacement of the rear terrace French doors, replacement of existing rear sash window with new French doors. \n\nInternal works include new waterproofing on all walls up to 1.2m, the removal of all flooring including screed, repair failed waterproofing, reinstate floor with acoustic treatment (to isolate noise from underground trains), underfloor heating and then to reinstate existing skirting. Note that the proposed floor level will remain largely similar to the existing. Finally, all existing joinery will be replaced, and all lighting circuits will be adjusted carefully with existing ceilings while keeping existing cornices.\n",
